      "lines": [
        "用三个数字 2 编一个数式，使它的值等于：",
        "а) 6；　　б) 8；　　в) 3；　　г) 1."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "7",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "下面哪几个式子没有意义？",
        "а) $\\frac{7.845}{4.18-2.09\\times2}$；　　б) $\\frac{6\\frac{1}{4}}{2\\frac{1}{3}\\times9-20}$；",
        "в) $\\frac{5\\frac{1}{3}-8\\frac{1}{6}}{0.8-1.2\\times\\frac{2}{3}}$；　　г) $\\frac{4-10.7}{1.68\\div4.2-2.5\\times0.16}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "8",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "不作计算，比较两个式的值的大小：",
        "а) $640\\times\\frac{7}{16}$ 和 $640\\div\\frac{7}{16}$；",
        "б) $243\\times(-\\frac{10}{27})$ 和 $243\\div(-\\frac{10}{27})$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "9",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
